flowchart LR
  Actors[Student / Teacher / Administrator]
  P1((1. Authenticate and authorize))
  P2((2. Run academic workflows))
  P3((3. Manage finance and reports))
  P4((4. Manage files and notifications))
  D1[(D1 Users, roles, preferences)]
  D2[(D2 Students, courses, registration)]
  D3[(D3 Grades, attendance, assignments)]
  D4[(D4 Fees, payment attempts, audit)]
  D5[(D5 Private uploaded files)]
  D6[(D6 Notifications)]
  Mail[Optional email provider]
  Actors -->|Credentials, role-allowed requests| P1
  P1 <-->|Identity and role checks| D1
  Actors -->|Course, roster, attendance, grade actions| P2
  P2 <-->|Academic records| D2
  P2 <-->|Grades, attendance, assignment data| D3
  Actors -->|Payment references, reviews, report requests| P3
  P3 <-->|Fee and payment records| D4
  P3 -->|Authorized report/export data| Actors
  Actors -->|Upload, download, notification actions| P4
  P4 <-->|Authorized file content and metadata| D5
  P4 <-->|Read/update notifications| D6
  P4 -. when enabled .-> Mail
